cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this dataset or cite a figure derived from it, please cite it
  using the metadata in this file.
type: dataset
title: "LayoffHedge Attention Index"
authors:
  - alias: 0xFlimbo
version: 1.0.0
date-released: "2026-09-23"
url: "https://attentionindex.org"
repository-code: "https://github.com/0xFlimbo/attention-index"
license:
  - MIT
  - CC-BY-4.0
abstract: >-
  A static, source-linked dataset and website documenting the public
  attention, amplification and media crossover of LayoffHedge, built from
  publicly verifiable posts, reposts, citations and press references. Every
  figure is derived at build time from the records in this repository, each
  of which links to the public source it was read from.
keywords:
  - open data
  - dataset
  - public attention
  - media coverage
  - layoffs
